    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax Sii Sheegid Ka Gees Ah Reer Turos",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana sannaddii kow iyo tobnaad, bisha maalinteedii kowaad Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, Reer Turos wuxuu Yeruusaalem ku yidhi, Ahaa, tii dadyowgii iriddiisa ahaan jirtay way jabtay, oo anigay ii soo jeedday, oo haddana waan buuxsanaan doonaa, waayo, iyadu haatan waa cidla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Reer Turosow, bal eeg, anigu col baan kugu ahaye, oo waxaan ka dhigi doonaa inay quruumo badanu kuugu soo kacaan siday baddu hirarkeeda u soo kiciso oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyagu derbiyada Turos way baabbi'in doonaan, oo munaaradaheedana way dumin doonaan, oo ciiddeedana waan ka xoqi doonaa, oo dhagax diiran oo kale baan ka dhigi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay noqon doontaa meel shabagyo lagu wadho oo badda dhexdeeda ku taal, waayo, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Aniga ayaa saas ku hadlay, oo booli bay quruumaha u noqon doontaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo gabdhaheeda berrinka joogana seef baa lagu wada layn doonaa; oo waxay ogaan doonaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal ogaada, waxaan Turos ku soo kicin doonaa boqorka Baabuloon oo ah Nebukadresar boqorkii boqorrada, oo xagga woqooyi buu ka iman doonaa isagoo wata fardo, iyo gaadhifardoodyo, iyo rag fardooley ah, iyo guuto ciidan ah, iyo dad faro badan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isagu gabdhahaaga berrinka jooga seef buu ku wada layn doonaa, oo qalcado buu kuu samaysan doonaa, oo tuulmo buu kuu tuulan doonaa, oo gaashaan weyn ayuu kor kuugu qaadan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuxuu derbiyadaada ku tumi doonaa wax lagu jejebiyo, oo munaaradahaagana wuxuu ku dumin doonaa faasaskiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo fardihiisa badan aawadood ayaa boodhkoodu ku qarin doonaa, oo derbiyadaaduna waxay la gariiri doonaan ragga fardooleyda buuqooda, iyo giraangiraha iyo gaadhifardoodyada gurdankooda, markuu irdahaaga u soo galo sida rag u soo galo magaalo dhinac laga faruuray oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qoobabka fardihiisa ayuu jidadkaaga oo dhan kula tuman doonaa, oo dadkaagana seef buu ku wada layn doonaa, oo tiirarkaaga adadaguna dhulkay ku soo dhici doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maalkaaga way dhici doonaan, oo booli ahaan bay baayacmushtarkaaga u qaadan doonaan, oo derbiyadaadana way dumin doonaan, oo daarahaaga qurqurxoonna way burburin doonaan, oo dhagxantaada iyo alwaaxdaada iyo boodhkaagaba biyahay ku dhex daadin doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan joojin doonaa qaylada heesahaaga, oo kataaradahaaga sanqadhoodana mar dambe lama maqli doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaanan kaa dhigi doonaa sida dhagax diiran oo kale, oo waxaad noqon doontaa meel shabagyada lagu dul wadho, oo mar dambena dib laguuma dhisi doono, waayo, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Aniga Ilaaha ah ayaa saas ku hadlay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu reer Turos ku leeyahay, Markii kuwa dhaawaca ahu cabaadaan oo dad badan dhexdaada lagu laayo, sow jasiiraduhu sanqadha dhiciddaada kama gariiri doonaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasay amiirrada badda oo dhammu carshiyadooda ka soo degi doonaan, oo waxay iska bixin doonaan khamiisyadooda, oo dharkooda daabaca lehna way iska saari doonaan, oo intay gariir xidhaan ayay dhulka fadhiisan doonaan, oo daqiiqad kastana way iska gariiri doonaan, wayna kula yaabi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo baroor ayay kor kuugu qaylin doonaan, oo waxay kugu odhan doonaan, Magaaladii caanka ahayd, oo dadka badaha maraa ay degganaayeen, oo badaha ku xoog badnayd iyada iyo dadkeeda degganuba, oo kuwa ku hareeraysan oo dhan ka cabsiin jirtayay, sidee baad u ba'day! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba maalinta dhiciddaada gasiiraduhu way wada gariiri doonaan, hubaal gasiiradaha badda ku dhex yaallaa bixitinkaaga aawadiis ayay la argaggixi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Markaan magaalo cidla ah kaa dhigo sida magaalooyinka aan ciduna degganayn oo kale iyo markaan moolka korkaaga ku soo daayo, oo ay biyo badanu ku daboolaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "markaasaan kula dejin doonaa kuwa yaamayska ku dhaadhaca, kuwaasoo ah dadkii waayihii hore jiri jiray, oo waxaan dhulka meesha ugu hoosaysa, oo ah meelo waa hore cidloobay, kula fadhiisin doonaa kuwa yaamayska ku dhaadhaca, si aan ciduna kuu degin, oo dalka kuwa noolna waxaan dhex dhigi doonaa sharaf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan kaa dhigi doonaa cabsi, oo innaba mar dambe siima aad jiri doontid. Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, In kastoo lagu doondoono kol dambe laguma heli doono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
